# Title: Renamed CreateDump Utility Execution
# ID: 1a1ed54a-2ba4-4221-94d5-01dee560d71e
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-20
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1036, attack.t1003.001, attack.credential-access
# Description: Detects uses of a renamed legitimate createdump.exe LOLOBIN utility to dump process memory
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((((process_exec="* -u *" AND process_exec="* -f *" AND process_exec="*.dmp*")) OR ((process_exec="* --full *" AND process_exec="* --name *" AND process_exec="*.dmp*"))) OR (process_name="FX_VER_INTERNALNAME_STR")) AND NOT ((process_path="*\\createdump.exe")))
